\ChangesListline {deleted}{Deleted\nobreakspace {}(del)}{The abstract should briefly summarize the contents of the paper in 150--250 words.}{1}
\ChangesListline {deleted}{Deleted\nobreakspace {}(del)}{Please note that the first paragraph of a section or subsection is not indented. The first paragraph that follows a table, figure, equation etc. does not need an indent, either. \par Subsequent paragraphs, however, are indented.}{1}
